# Apex — Cursor Rules

## Stack
- React Native + Expo (SDK 57+), file-based expo-router
- NativeWind v4 (Tailwind utility classes via `className`)
- Reanimated 3/4 + Gesture Handler for UI-thread motion only
- Supabase (PostgreSQL + PostGIS, Auth, Storage)
- TanStack React Query + Zustand (offline trail cache)
- Icons: lucide-react-native or SF Symbols (stroke 1.5–1.75)

## Design
- High-density, utilitarian, tactile, restrained (Linear / Beli / Arc)
- Monochrome zinc/slate foundation; single earthy accent (sage/olive)
- No purple gradients, no floaty shadows, no bubbly cards, no emoji spam
- Borders: 1px zinc-800; radii ≤ `rounded-xl`
- Micro-haptics on toggle/log; spring physics (not ease-in-out float)
- Sheets via `@gorhom/bottom-sheet`

## Architecture
- Strict TypeScript interfaces
- Business logic in hooks (`useTrailTracker`, `useRankings`, `useTrailComparison`)
- Optimistic UI for ranking + logging
- Keep screens thin; components presentational

## Accent token
- `--accent` / `accent`: #8B9A6D (sage olive)
